# identifier_allowlist transform (CC-LAB-0096): maps {{ value_expr }} (the
# raw sort key) through a fixed, code-controlled dict of known-safe column
# names, defaulting to "id" for any unrecognized key -- the resulting
# value is always a hardcoded string from this dict, never user-controlled
# content, closing both the ORDER-BY-position and identifier-substitution
# concerns at once (lab/safety_matrix.yaml's own `identifier_allowlist`
# row neutralises both).
{{ value_expr }} = _ORDER_BY_ALLOWLIST.get({{ value_expr }}, "id")
